    "name": "Sled and hills",
    "mode": "run",
    "work": "Sled push 6 x 20 m, 3 sets, or hill sprints 8-10 x 10-15 s",
    "rest": "30 s between pushes; walk back on hills",
    "intensity": "Near max",
    "perWeek": 1,
    "why": "Repeat explosive efforts when practice is short of live work."
   }
  ],
